        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 22:17",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "And the king of Israel said unto Jehoshaphat, Did I not tell thee that he would prophesy no good concerning me, but evil?",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 22:18",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "And he said, Hear thou therefore the word of the Lord: I saw the Lord sitting on his throne, and all the host of heaven standing by him on his right hand and on his left.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 22:19",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Lord said, Who shall persuade Ahab, that he may go up and fall at Ramoth-gilead? And one said on this manner, and another said on that manner.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 22:20",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "And there came forth a spirit, and stood before the Lord, and said, I will persuade him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 22:21",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Lord said unto him, Wherewith? And he said, I will go forth, and I will be a lying spirit in the mouth of all his prophets. And he said, Thou shalt persuade him, and prevail also: go forth, and do so.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 90,
            "text": "See JST 2 Chr. 18:22 (2 Chr. 18:22 note a). Isa. 19:14 (11–14)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 165,
            "end": 169
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Kings 22:22",
        "book": "1 Kings",
        "chapter": 22,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "Now therefore, behold, the Lord hath put a lying spirit in the mouth of all these thy prophets, and the Lord hath spoken evil concerning thee.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 43,
            "end": 48,
            "text": "2 Chr. 18:22."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "2 Chr. 18:22.",
            "prettyString": "2 Chronicles 18:22",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "2chronicles",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 18,
