      {
        "text": "And one washed the chariot in the pool of Samaria; and the dogs licked up his blood; and they washed his armour; according unto the word of the Lord which he spake.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 7
          }
